@balancesUrl = http://localhost:3003
@accountId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@accountToId = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb

### Saldo projetado pelo consumidor Kafka
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/{{accountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Bob: saldo inicial 500; após transferência de 100, saldo 600
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/{{accountToId}}
Accept: application/json

### Transferência: Alice 1000 -> 900; Bob 500 -> 600 (instalação limpa)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id_from": "{{accountId}}",
  "account_id_to": "{{accountToId}}",
  "amount": 100
}

### Consultar Alice novamente após o consumo Kafka
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/{{accountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Consultar Bob novamente após o consumo Kafka
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/{{accountToId}}
Accept: application/json

### Conta inexistente: HTTP 404
GET {{balancesUrl}}/balances/conta-inexistente
Accept: application/json
